/-! # Normalized word-image tensors of the identification Eighth[37]+ <-> Seventh[32]+ (record
goctad:E26+, e = 1)

The net field values of the packed tensors `wGoctadE26pHX` and `wGoctadE26pGX` (divided by `2 ^
12` and `2 ^ 17`), stored as compact literals and certified by one cross-sum check per column; the
parts evaluate no word image. -/

